    "section1Title": "1. Taarifa Tunazokusanya",
    "section1Body": "Tunakusanya taarifa unazotoa moja kwa moja, kama jina lako, maelezo ya mawasiliano, anwani, na taarifa za malipo, ili kukuunganisha na watoa huduma.",
    "section2Title": "2. Jinsi Tunavyotumia Taarifa Yako",
    "section2Body": "Taarifa yako hutumika kuchakata uhifadhi, kuwezesha mawasiliano na watoa huduma, kutuma masasisho ya uhifadhi, na kuboresha huduma zetu.",
